OL,3,GNEWSAGuest house partially washed away
OL,4,Ain flood goes up for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hawick guest house and cafe that was
OL,7,Fpartially washed away in floods has
OL,8,Fgone on the market.
OL,10,FVideo footage captured the moment
OL,11,Friver-facing walls of the Bridge Guest
OL,12,FHouse building dramatically collapsed
OL,13,Finto the Teviot at the height of Storm
OL,14,FCiara in February 2020.
OL,16,FAt the time, owner Gino Antonacci told
OL,17,Fthe BBC that he had managed to get all
OL,18,Fguests out as river levels continued to
OL,19,Frise and cracks began to appear in the
OL,20,Fwalls.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
